+
+		/*
+		 * Pins 4-7 are hard-wired to eMMC with 1.8V IO voltage,
+		 * with all pins sharing a single voltage domain.
+		 *
+		 * Configure as input without pull to avoid accidental use,
+		 * e.g. as gpio (default pin-function).
